<title>SWEDEN: Swedish repo rate drains 42 bln SKR from market.</title>
<headline>Swedish repo rate drains 42 bln SKR from market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Tuesday it drained 42 billion crowns from the market in its weekly reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was lowered 25 basis points to 4.35 percent and will run from November 27 to December 4, replacing an operation that drained 44 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 10.45 percent of bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
